        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S-DP675  Solid Brass 6 Inch Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHigh quality solid brass door pull that is not to plain, but not to fancy - This is our best selling 6\" shower door pull. Available in your choice of <b>9 high quality finish colors</b>. Manufactured by Deltana the nations most complete provider of all of your solid brass door hardware needs. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Longer <a href=\"/products/8-inch-back-to-back-shower-door-pulls-sd-dp2574\"><b>8 Inch Shower Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/10-inch-back-to-back-shower-door-pulls-sd-dp2575\"><b>10 Inch Shower Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting (pulls hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of Deltana  S-DP675 Glass Shower Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 6\" </li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Back to Back Glass Door Kit</li>\r\n<li> Available Finishes: 9</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
